      "contents": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-dce29752-7d5a-4fc8-9391-85f729fd226b\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:800px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-dce29752-7d5a-4fc8-9391-85f729fd226b\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA5MTZfMjYx/MDAxNzU4MDE0MDE0MTcy.xKJcJX21ssNTZfsT6QuKojhKPhOPDxHlYtPmqvnST78g.xHLdnmtxB-RjXSTEg71z7PNAGqyhO6E-J0iPlvXHYWwg.PNG/241030_%EA%B3%B5%EC%A7%80%EC%82%AC%ED%95%AD_800x236.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"800\", \"originalHeight\" : \"236\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA5MTZfMjYx/MDAxNzU4MDE0MDE0MTcy.xKJcJX21ssNTZfsT6QuKojhKPhOPDxHlYtPmqvnST78g.xHLdnmtxB-RjXSTEg71z7PNAGqyhO6E-J0iPlvXHYWwg.PNG/241030_%EA%B3%B5%EC%A7%80%EC%82%AC%ED%95%AD_800x236.png?type=w1678\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-dce29752-7d5a-4fc8-9391-85f729fd226b\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-2eb78412-b070-4f83-8455-78294e2897b5\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-90229701-b8a2-440c-9d4c-88abb04774b8\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1b4336d6-2e98-4832-9738-3e82a9729bd3\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-95647653-2d33-4f76-9780-b7de5dfb4648\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eb5c44f2-cb6b-4f3b-a42f-b37074c43199\">입니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5213ee39-cd97-411a-bf02-b7f7c3300beb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5375d382-a520-4e61-88dc-0916c15a3de0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6563fceb-6940-40c2-b4a2-153954f12c28\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d8305fd6-01ac-4baa-a473-88aec42a3573\">솔로 레이드 전투 중 발생하는 이슈의 원인이 확인되어</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b6d4ef49-aad5-4bd6-86ca-8a068fb0affe\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-42548f64-05eb-47c9-be49-c386625ab463\">금일 무점검 업데이트를 통해 수정될 예정입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-51d62a23-054a-42ea-9768-40269d5b8e5a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-80a9fff3-284c-43f3-8a08-cd2d99c726a1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bcfd07ad-400b-40d1-a35f-c4fbb9dcab54\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b652f803-0fdc-4bff-8df5-db2f8d15a101\">업데이트 적용 과정에서 일시적으로 서버 연결이 중단될 수 있으며,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-228c08cf-f40a-4b96-a6fd-85f041159bf2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2455ca4c-690f-44c8-9290-fb98ffe8433f\">게임 종료 후 재접속하시면 최신 버전을 이용하실 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6609c2a1-9fae-4cf3-a7f9-fe1986a08593\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-86677707-1018-47c9-9431-903586282ed0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e8e8b15b-3d24-4d39-9a19-c16a54774af3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aab89c72-cf11-4c49-944d-4c55a73a3ff0\">자세한 내용은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-621e8159-5c42-401e-b9d6-c66f215d54e4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fdbbaec7-7867-455a-a354-2870d73e3780\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-77da8a55-ec0f-4a25-8e23-cab75c80c0d5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8c720e52-e39c-432b-b067-f28216c257cd\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4dfc6aa0-1c9e-4497-b2c9-a5689e201ea7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5d4fcaaa-3c40-47f4-96b2-20fd91cd036d\"><b>📢 솔로 레이드 관련 진행 상황 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e417d1ce-258c-4a1b-b1ac-36fea2e8d7a0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9e4b98e6-9644-4110-aeb0-dd1109ee8b80\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b6fcb3dc-322e-4e5e-9d4b-707404c78935\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-552239ff-eb1a-4db3-be7d-61b4676171b6\"><b>​✔️ 무점검 업데이트 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7d42c833-b914-491a-acd8-ceacf0795280\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-95912ee4-de8e-4e43-af7b-0611628746c4\">- 9/17(수) 16:00 ~ 17:30 경</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-02027ec2-bc05-4ed0-89a7-7571dd51102b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ab720d5d-8f0c-4ba3-b9bc-fb10a6eb258a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3fc865bd-0b62-4229-b6e1-e7caafd1e237\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7de1c756-0abe-4279-8898-80b4a7fe1894\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5c1f9b62-440c-4f9a-83b2-b684ef2a5173\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d19a3e53-ff6f-4df9-a1a7-471f765e9de1\">- 솔로 레이드에서 마더 웨일과 전투 중, 특정 상황에서 전투 패턴이 의도와 다르게 동작하는 현상 수정</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1a80c422-8eca-4465-946d-c19137b26258\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-424d533e-48ae-451b-b358-f9d557bbee3b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1a7eb6d1-81f4-46f8-bd03-c0e6861a3d72\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f3d98c3e-0905-4d92-9c53-cd0b3f19aebe\">​​​※ 업데이트 중 일시적으로 서버와 연결이 중단되며, 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e48af1d5-fce8-4d6c-838f-d427ea243148\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a469a516-1606-428e-adcc-8c64e2798d17\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f1b405e4-68ce-4bfb-be23-43979a390d2f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-da7ca219-060e-421e-8b7d-ceaa8020019d\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f71cca1c-aa8d-4ecb-9c2c-78765c729ee9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-422c71a2-700e-44b9-96fb-eed8e5eb94b5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-678912aa-c5c0-4e31-be95-23ebe2b86865\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ceb732b6-16db-4fd2-860a-5a45189a0831\">​게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐드린 점, 깊이 사과드리며</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d655c335-9314-4103-9ffd-ee7f28251b6c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a2626964-9c78-4a7a-98dd-256b19de494e\">추가로 확인되는 내용이 있는 경우 후속 공지를 통해 안내해 드리겠습니다..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-2eb78412-b070-4f83-8455-78294e2897b5\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line1\" id=\"SE-e5fa7143-af60-4918-a463-8b723c89ec13\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-line1 se-section-align-\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-593f5543-c357-4824-a096-d9ba1357c424\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-95aacd51-3a00-4bee-8b7d-a79a2b9f46e2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-22e9484c-c303-43f5-9564-d59aea1e7d60\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5862c07b-0658-4895-8448-b18840d872ea\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-58e5a3e5-e9a0-4c6f-b59c-d0cb5568eaf1\">입니다.​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-37729df8-72cc-4652-982a-ebf0a7cdf44b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cc33ede3-900a-4c3d-bdb2-d7f7ff9e128d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f6330b0-30ba-4ce0-b8b1-79f0cc53f79a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e691fafa-e5b3-4403-91cf-92436b186328\">현재 솔로 레이드 전투 시 발생하는 현상에 대하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c7b3c5a-253f-49c3-b429-5e0a393835a4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5d410b95-9f70-4b06-9e69-fc9fc0c61be7\">상황 및 원인을 긴급 확인 중입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d465d7a0-aa4b-4ab0-8531-73446c9e50f7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5523da33-853d-4687-bee8-7b43ad7ac539\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5237efd8-7167-4d90-b3b7-18bc9098e142\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aa77a179-4253-4ff4-86b6-e3bd382cb9e1\">​​자세한 내용은 아래를 확인해 주세요.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4acafa53-4f16-4e1d-9f4d-9cd9bddb2c39\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5839735b-ff80-45fb-99f2-0902b0becbf9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2da780f6-c7f7-4481-829f-c2707d82b0f9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-65b2dac3-11d6-4ac0-a7a5-6aaf57d597b5\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b8437459-e46a-43e2-ba2e-65eadba3428e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8c00b531-e492-4da3-99af-659cde8e63a2\"><b>📢  솔로 레이드 관련 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-795973ec-451d-4f80-9a51-6496be38f15a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-bd1c2c8d-04f1-447b-9fec-f528c1e9dec3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f510bb4d-20ad-4047-819d-9b48e27e799d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d76d7009-59a4-4dba-9a68-9aee44aee7f9\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-790c636b-17ca-41dc-9267-b5691ec8c120\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-88ffef1a-477b-451c-8ed8-3afc11b1976d\">- 9/16(화)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-63a0a276-6865-4d09-bd82-16cda95eb07c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f40c09ca-ef47-4ced-bee4-755250144a76\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a8a23583-e72a-451c-b3ff-3cb94dae15dd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-472d08f6-cfc9-4f2a-bec2-84eedae8f293\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-009a1856-a689-435a-a83b-f3e25e9ed560\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7bcb87d6-9c70-42f0-8783-b5863a8e7584\">- 솔로 레이드에서 마더웨일과 전투 중 특정 상황에서 마더웨일의 전투 패턴이 의도와 다